{"id": "idaho-3", "headline": "Ballet Idaho brings Nutcracker to Caldwell", "source": "KIVI", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/caldwell/weeks-of-rehearsals-months-of-preparation-bring-ballet-idahos-nutcracker-to-caldwell", "published": "2026-11-26", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Ballet Idaho is bringing its Nutcracker to Caldwell, where Caldwell Fine Arts is hosting the company for a fourth straight year. Set pieces such as presents and brick walls can take about a year to design, build and ship. Dancers typically spend four to six weeks preparing. Principal dancer Lizzie Kanning said they take an hour and a half ballet class daily, then five hours of rehearsal and a one hour lunch, a full nine to five day. In Caldwell, dancers must adjust to the theater while crews handle set changes, and a children's cast adds more rehearsal. Kanning will dance Marzipan and Dew Drop in Caldwell. At the Morrison Center in Boise she also performs the Sugar Plum Fairy. Source: KIVI."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110110010101010011001100110101111111", "10000010010010001001001001001001101000001", "10111010001000001010011001100010101011101", "10111010001000000010110101000110001011101", "10111010001011110111000000001011001011101", "10000010000110100110010100101000101000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000111101000001001001011011000000000", "11011010011010110100100110100101101000001", "10110101011010110011011110110111010111100", "11101010100010110110101100010100101000100", "01001001001010101111000010000100100011001", "11101010101011101111101110011001101100001", "11000101010000001110000110111010001111011", "00011110101110101001100011110111001110001", "11100100101100010010001110100000010001101", "01001010101011000000000101000001010000000", "00001100001001010001111000010011100010010", "10111111000110011001010100111111001001101", "01001101011010101111101111001001111110110", "11110011110001110001000100101100011000111", "10110001000010101011011101011111000111010", "